{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2026-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1778198400, "end_date": 1778889599, "month_true_total": 85, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:03:12 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "225586446", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046276439", "personaname": "Maalin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/maalinism/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 5523, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4313, "last_played": 1785438973, "avatar": "5004deb1423ae9b2e1fb9aeba6834a2d9551205a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Listen guys, it's not Mass Effect but it's Mass Effect. There are going to be many things that reminds of you home but you gotta take this game for exactly what it is - the quest for a new home (legit the story!). Scorching deserts, humid jungles, harrowing undergrounds, open plains and space, so much space, awaits you. \r\n\r\nThe story isn't too strong in my opinion, but many of the characters are great and you will find yourself swamped with different quests and tasks. As the Pathfinder Team Recon Specialist, you gotta carve your way forward for all of us, if the galaxy is going to stand a chance. \r\n\r\nWelcome home, Pathfinder.", "timestamp_created": 1778866639, "timestamp_updated": 1778866639, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.53125", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225501174", "author": {"steamid": "76561198160361269", "personaname": "theVENOMcurse", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198160361269/", "num_games_owned": 466, "num_reviews": 46, "playtime_forever": 3258, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3258, "last_played": 1778788452, "avatar": "b1efa617cc1acec009153244320824705e2bdcba"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game was honestly Amazing I really enjoyed Playing as Ryder and the crew was awesome. Gameplay was solid maybe too many side quests lol but they are optional for a reason. The main story was great and I truly enjoyed it. The game is Just in a big shadow of the trilogy It doesn't deserve all the hate. Starts slow but man I was sad when the ride was over.", "timestamp_created": 1778788619, "timestamp_updated": 1778788619, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519999980926513672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 32, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "225498743", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970676190", "personaname": "Geist", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970676190/", "num_games_owned": 152, "num_reviews": 99, "playtime_forever": 3696, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2615, "last_played": 1780090831, "avatar": "5a1630b2ed69683a230f151a58d7c9ed77f906af"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great Game!", "timestamp_created": 1778786983, "timestamp_updated": 1778786983, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225465788", "author": {"steamid": "76561198714703090", "personaname": "Brightbill007", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198714703090/", "num_games_owned": 26, "num_reviews": 3, "playtim